# N8b: N8a at real speed, the trigger held from film second 0.5: id's nails start wide of
# the gun's barrels.
#
# Under V3-37: "QuakeC fires each nail six point seven units above the barrel. At
# ten-eighty, you can tell. So now they leave the barrels."

map e1m1

duration 3.9
fps 60
size 1920x1080

preset slop
hud on
gun on
crosshair 1
player 480,-352,88,90
cvar r_nailbarrels 0
cvar gamma 0.8

impulse 9 at 0
impulse 4 at 0.1
attack on at 0.5

camera player

sound on
events on
